Name: STAR_2019_I1708793
Year: 2019
Summary: Fiducial W+, W-, and Z/gamma* longitudinal-spin yields at 510 GeV
Experiment: STAR
Collider: RHIC
InspireID: 1708793
Status: UNVALIDATED
Reentrant: true
Authors:
