RunInfo: Requires PP, PM, MP, and MM polarized pp samples for each hard channel.
NumEvents: 100000
NeedsCrossSection: yes
Beams: [[p+, p+]]
Energies: [[255.0, 255.0]]
Description:
  Uses prompt electrons dressed with photons in R=0.1. W candidates satisfy
  25 < ET < 50 GeV and |eta| < 1.5. Z/gamma* candidates contain two isolated
  opposite-charge dressed electrons with ET > 14 GeV, |eta| < 1.1, and
  70 < mee < 110 GeV. Physical-helicity yields are combined externally with
  beam exchange and eta reflection.
